# Enables best-effort post-run knowledge extraction (see README's Knowledge
# base section). Without it, knowledge capture is silently skipped and runs
# are unaffected. Also reserved for a future schema-validated LLM planner.
# Never commit live credentials, session cookies, or test-account passwords.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Test accounts are resolved by the browser adapter, not sent to the model.
# TEST_ACCOUNT_STANDARD_EMAIL=
# TEST_ACCOUNT_STANDARD_PASSWORD=
